OL,3,GNEWSA'Bring it on': Flynn challenges
OL,4,ABurnham on independence referendum
OL,5,
OL,6,FSNP minister Stephen Flynn has called
OL,7,Fon the prime minister to "bring it on"
OL,8,Fand let the people of Scotland decide
OL,9,Fthe country's future in an independence
OL,10,Freferendum.
OL,12,FFlynn, the party's former Westminster
OL,13,Fleader and now transport secretary at
OL,14,FHolyrood, said the independence
OL,15,Fmovement was facing its greatest-ever
OL,16,Fchallenge.
OL,18,FBut he insisted "we are winning the
OL,19,Fargument" and told delegates at the SNP
OL,20,Fconference in Aberdeen that "all of us
OL,21,Fshould feel pride in how far our
OL,22,Fmovement has come".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
