OL,3,GNEWSA'Bring it on': Flynn challenges
OL,4,ABurnham on independence referendum
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Prime Minister Andy
OL,7,FBurnham told MPs a border poll would be
OL,8,Fconsidered in both Scotland and
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland if there was a clear
OL,10,Fconsensus and public opinion had
OL,11,Fchanged.
